 AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">신청방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">직업훈련포털</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">(HRD-NET)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">가입 후 온라인 신청(내일배움카드 소지자)</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, AppleSDGothicNeo, Dotum, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">\t</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">7.</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">교육문의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">: 054-478-7241</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, AppleSDGothicNeo, Dotum, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">\t</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmBYHoQdkhhAmgTwEoHUA2AHAsgcQCkA5ADwBUAhASwGUBRc7AYwDpsA7AcyA%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\" alt=\"국립금오공과대학교 (Kumoh National Institute of Technology) 100% 국비지원교육 파이썬 코딩과 IoT융합 개발자 과정, 8월 5일 ~ 10월 8일 (매주 월 ~ 금 18:30 ~ 22:30